  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "\"The Beach House and Carriage\" BY Bespoke Management (STR2025-044386)<br><br>Nestled quietly on the peaceful corner of Round Road and East Water in Rosemary Beach, just south of 30A, “The Beach House and Carriage” by Bespoke Management awaits its next guests, patiently anticipating the perfect family ready for an escape to the beach!<br><br>Key Features: <br>*4 bedroom main house<br>*private 2 bedroom carriage house<br>*2 minutes to the beach<br>*Heated Coquina pool 1 minute away<br>*4 community pools<br>*Wrap-around porches<br>*Outdoor dining and grill area<br>*Steps to Rosemary Town Center<br>*XBOX included<br><br>OVERVIEW<br>Located in the heart of Rosemary Beach, The Beach House is a quick trip from chic shops, gourmet restaurants, community pools, and world-class local attractions. Stay in for a quiet evening in this spacious home or be part of the safe and charming nightlife of local beach communities including Rosemary and Alys. The Beach House provides a beach vacation with the luxuries and accommodations of being in a lively city. The house which is engulfed by the rustling green foliage natural to Florida, beautifully and thoughtfully designed and decorated, offers to meet every feature of a home while doing so luxuriously. The Beach House combines southern-charm living with European design, blending for a truly elegant and comfortable stay all within steps of the white-sandy beaches of the Emerald Coast. From the two wrap-around porches to the large open-concept kitchen, comfortable living chambers, and lavish bedrooms, The Beach House entices private intimate moments with your loved ones, making for a lifetime of memories. This property is part of the New Urbanism and Traditional Neighborhood Development, producing a harmonious balance and placing a vacation to Rosemary Beach on the top of everyone’s wish list. <br><br>Creating the means to disconnect and cherish intentional family time is highly encouraged in this home. The outdoor dining courtyard is a perfect escape from the hustle of Rosemary Beach while offering a beautiful natural experience engulfed by plants and trees. If you are looking to rest and wind down, The Beach House offers lavish space for each member of the family to have some “you” time. Whether that time is spent tucked away with a book and a cup of coffee in one of the charming outdoor seating spaces, in a cozy bed, or in one of the living rooms, you are sure to find much-deserved rest. The homeowners intentionally furnished each room and living space with comfortable and clean pieces to make guests feel welcomed, cared for, and, most importantly, at home. The superb location of The Beach House allows you and your guests to always be within walking distance of nearly every need that may arise. If you are looking for a pool or a beach, a restaurant or a shop, a social gathering, or an intimate moment, the location of this home offers them all. The only difficulty with this home is deciding what you are going to do first!<br><br>THE SPACE<br>As you approach The Beach House you will be welcomed by the grand entrance featuring a wrap-around porch lined with an abundance of rocking chairs and beautiful gas-lit sconces. Feel free to sit down and soak it all in, your vacation of a lifetime is about to begin. After walking through the beautiful dark wood French-style doors you will enter the lower-level living chamber. This room is packed with comfortable couches and chairs, lovely decor, and wall-to-wall windows, offering a perfect place to unwind with a book, sip your morning coffee, or watch a movie with family. Taking the hall just past the living chamber leads you past the half bathroom, which is both clean and cozy, to the open-concept kitchen and dining room. This space is filled with natural light, access to the screened back porch, painted beautifully white like the rest of the home, contrasting the hardwood floors ever so lovely. The dining area features a large table with seating for eight underneath an extravagant chandelier, a comfortable window nook equipped with pillows for those early morning quiet times, and both a wine and beverage fridge for your enjoyment. The spacious kitchen comes with stainless steel appliances including a large double-door refrigerator, gas-top oven, and microwave. The kitchen also offers a plethora of cooking and dinnerware for your cooking and dining needs. It has been said that the fondest memories are created around the dinner table and the design of this space at The Beach House curates just that. <br>Moving back down the hall towards the front door is where the stairs leading up to the bedrooms are located. The second floor hosts the master bedroom and bathroom, two guest rooms, and a large balcony on the north side with a porch swing and comfortable outdoor seating. Vaulted ceilings, a dedicated HVAC system, a large private balcony with seating, a private attached large bathroom, and a cozy king-sized bed create a luxurious master bedroom sanctuary. The suite also features comfortable seating, a dedicated workspace, and storage for your personal belongings. The ensuite bathroom hosts separate his and her vanity sinks, an armoire and closet space for your convenience, and a large shower and toilet space beautifully designed with shiplap walls and four showerheads. The master suite also features a dedicated private covered balcony with seating. In the hallway outside the master suite, a cozy seating area houses a Keurig coffee maker and mugs for mornings on the balcony sipping coffee– just in case making it down the stairs that early seems unmanageable. <br>Separating the two additional bedrooms, a full-sized bathroom with his and her vanity, a shower and tub, and a pocket door separating the bath and toilet from the rest of the space. The two guest bedrooms each boast king-sized beds, while an upper-level washer and dryer fill the landing space. Each of these bedrooms offers all the comforts of home: a bed fit for royalty, comfortable seating, storage space for your belongings, a television to unwind, and beautiful views surrounded by trees. On the upper levels, it can feel like you are in a treehouse with all the natural scenery encapsulating the home. <br>Taking the final steps to the third floor you are led to a television room, where you can relax on the couch while your favorite movie plays or step out to the balcony which provides perfect views of the southern coastal sky. The third-floor guest room is equipped with two built-in twin beds and trundles underneath sleeping a total of four. The bedroom also has a comfortable chair, dedicated storage space, and a bookshelf for the little ones. The bathroom is adjacent to the guest room and features a walk-in shower. This is a perfect space for kids to enjoy.<br>As you enter the property through the courtyard gate and begin the ascent up the stairs to the carriage house you will surely notice the serene quietness and beautiful natural green foliage that surrounds the home. You will enter the carriage house from the wrap-around porch which is lined with windows. The windows of the carriage house allow for as much or as little natural lighting as you desire. For your convenience, each of these windows is fixed with blinds to add a level of privacy as you want it. Upon stepping into the space you will undoubtedly be greeted by the warm sunlight peeking through the windows, the loveliness of the decorations that fill the home, and the cozy furnishings for you to rest on. The ambiance of this home possesses both charm and grandeur. <br>The layout of the main chamber is the kitchen, dining, and living space in the southern portion of the home. At the same time, the plush king-sized bed, television, and storage space for your belongings are in the north. The full-sized bathroom is just off the kitchen and is equipped with a large tile shower, vanity and sink all behind a pocket door. The shiplap-lined bunk room offers additional sleeping space with two twin beds and a closet as an added benefit. The home is filled with beautiful hardwood floors throughout. <br>The carriage house, designed as a studio suite with a full bathroom, accommodating kitchen, living chamber, comfortable king-sized bed, bunkroom, and wrap-around porch, creates a perfect cozy retreat for a couple or small family in the group that promises to meet your vacation needs with an escape to a world-class beach vacation.<br>As you enter the property through the courtyard gate and begin the ascent up the stairs to the carriage house you will surely notice the serene quietness and beautiful natural green foliage that surrounds the home. You will enter the carriage house from the wrap-around porch which is lined with windows. The windows of the carriage house allow for as much or as little natural lighting as you desire. For your convenience, each of these windows is fixed with blinds to add a level of privacy as you want it. Upon stepping into the space you will undoubtedly be greeted by the warm sunlight peeking through the windows, the loveliness of the decorations that fill the home, and the cozy furnishings for you to rest on. The ambiance of this home possesses both charm and grandeur. <br>The layout of the main chamber is the kitchen, dining, and living space in the southern portion of the home. At the same time, the plush king-sized bed, television, and storage space for your belongings are in the north. The full-sized bathroom is just off the kitchen and is equipped with a large tile shower, vanity and sink all behind a pocket door. The shiplap-lined bunk room offers additional sleeping space with two twin beds and a closet as an added benefit. The home is filled with beautiful hardwood floors throughout.<br>The carriage house's full kitchen offers independence from the main house with it's own cooking and dinnerware utensils, a stainless steel oven, gas top range, white quartz countertops, and a detached island with a sink, dishwasher and bar seating accommodating four. The living chamber is just off the kitc",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
